    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dodecadone",
    "steam_appid": 2754840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754840/extras/094d23d459f174767df9b88e26733402.avif?t=1721820103\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >28 traits, tons of shapes</h2>Press space for a triangle, one of many variety.<br><br>That shape might be<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bouncy<br></li><li> Spinning<br></li><li> Racist<br></li><li> Protesting gravity<br></li><li> Sick<br></li><li> <i>Or one of many others...</i></li></ul><br>Your task is to gather them all, make sense of it, and merge your geometric friends and foes to a square. Then, a pentagon, a septagon, a hexagon...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many others, then... you're dodecadone.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754840/extras/bc45342b83d703fb09e2fc1868036ebf.avif?t=1721820103\" width=616 height=170 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Full modding support- anything from new traits to entirely new games!<br></li><li> 9 Unique themes, including full transparency<br></li><li> Custom themes with CSS<br></li><li> Cheats menu<br></li><li> Scoring system &amp; speedrunning timer<br></li><li> Practically every language ever via automatic translation<br></li><li> Silly english for the goofsters<br></li><li> 100% free, only with donations. Open-source under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754840/extras/094d23d459f174767df9b88e26733402.avif?t=1721820103\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >28 traits, tons of shapes</h2>Press space for a triangle, one of many variety.<br><br>That shape might be<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bouncy<br></li><li> Spinning<br></li><li> Racist<br></li><li> Protesting gravity<br></li><li> Sick<br></li><li> <i>Or one of many others...</i></li></ul><br>Your task is to gather them all, make sense of it, and merge your geometric friends and foes to a square. Then, a pentagon, a septagon, a hexagon...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many others, then... you're dodecadone.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754840/extras/bc45342b83d703fb09e2fc1868036ebf.avif?t=1721820103\" width=616 height=170 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Full modding support- anything from new traits to entirely new games!<br></li><li> 9 Unique themes, including full transparency<br></li><li> Custom themes with CSS<br></li><li> Cheats menu<br></li><li> Scoring system &amp; speedrunning timer<br></li><li> Practically every language ever via automatic translation<br></li><li> Silly english for the goofsters<br></li><li> 100% free, only with donations. Open-source under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A physics &amp; logic puzzler about merging shapes and traits, similar to Suika games. A triangle might be bouncy, your septagon sick &amp; coughing, or an ennenagon defying the laws of physics.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
